# 统一换行：源码在库里一律 LF，检出时按平台处理，避免 Windows/Mac 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确二进制，别做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

# PowerShell 脚本保留 CRLF（Windows 上更稳）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
